  "body": "Presentation-only polish based on the latest screenshots.\n\nChanges:\n- tightens Price Matrix row spacing, especially the `Posiadane boty` column\n- fixes the negotiation reaction layout so the left rejection card no longer stretches to the height of the wide counter-offer card\n- lets immediate-action selectors use the full row width instead of leaving a dead empty column\n- improves counter-offer threshold spacing/alignment and remove-button placement\n- makes success states visibly green, primary/info states more vivid blue, warnings amber and failures red while keeping the overall light/flat visual language\n- upgrades Dashboard purchase effectiveness and success KPI accents\n- strengthens PURCHASED/history success styling\n- makes bot RUNNING/status/quota progress more readable and lively\n- keeps surfaces flat: no glass, no 3D, no heavy shadows\n\nScope is frontend presentation only: one new CSS override file and one import in main.tsx. No API, backend, persistence, scheduler, quota, negotiation behavior or business logic changes.",
